preferred_term: R2A broth DAIGO
ingredient_type: NAMED_MEDIUM
supplied_form:
- name: R2A broth DAIGO
  supplier: FUJIFILM Wako; historical Nihon Pharm. source
  catalog_number: 395-01681
  form: dehydrated broth powder
  notes: NBRC1455 identifies exact code and JCM839 names NihonPharm premix. Current
    Wako page lists manufacturer LABOLOGY; no equivalence to other brands is asserted.
notes: JCM805 uses0.32g/L at1/10 strength; NBRC1455 uses3.2g/L. The product is the
  same broth premix, with dose retained in recipes. JCM839 provides the full listed
  formulation and explicitly names DAIGO premix. Do not equate with R2Aagar; MICRO0000541
  has an internally inconsistent liquid definition and agar-bearing quoted formula
  and is not asserted as exact grounding.
