component_assertion:
  method: RECIPE_TRANSCRIPTION
  completeness: COMPLETE
  evidence:
  - evidence_type: RECIPE_SOURCE
    source: https://www.jcm.riken.jp/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=839
    source_record: JCM839 R2A BROTH component table and DAIGO premix comment
    notes: Eight dry ingredients per litre of prepared broth.1L distilled water is
      the preparation solvent, not part of the purchased dry powder. Components remain
      literal UNMAPPED references; no external chemical identity assignment is implied.
  notes: Concentrations refer to prepared full-strength broth;0.32g/L dilution in
    JCM805 is an occurrence condition. The approximate sum3.15g/L is compatible with
    the supplier3.2g/L instruction, not an additional ingredient claim.
